# os / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json



# helm: resolved subchart archives.
# `helm dependency update` packs charts/common into each chart's charts/ directory as a
# .tgz. That is a build artifact of a chart already in this repo, so committing it would
# store the same templates twice and let the copy drift. Chart.lock IS committed, so the
# resolution is reproducible: run `helm dependency build charts/<name>` after cloning.
charts/*/charts/

